<title>POLAND: KROSNO JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.59 vs   0.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.35 vs   1.34</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.21 vs   1.14</p>
<p> Sales		   15.64 vs  14.08</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.28 vs   6.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.88 vs   9.59</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.19 vs  10.23</p>
<p> Sales		   92.67 vs  90.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Krosno SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
